# Source-linked replay for the bounded L7 three-payload formal model.
#
# This leaf invokes existing compiler/cache owners. Receipt issuance remains
# NotChecked until owner-authenticated proof, runner, fixture, and mutant
# receipts exist. It never promotes to SourceRefined, activates a worker, grants semantic
# authority, publishes a generation, or claims crash durability.

